  contentsAnswer: Gym clothes. Personal stuff. Do we really have to discuss it?
  weightAnswer: Fine. There are weights underneath. About sixteen kilos. I train
    when I cannot sleep.
  metalAnswer: Cast iron weights. I did not want the lecture about hotel floors.
  packingAnswer: One weight is loose at the bottom. There is a towel between them.
  responseAnswer: A quick heavy knock. Nothing should carry on moving after that.
  authorReasoning: 'Deliberately evasive innocent: 15.8 kg and strong metal are explained
    on follow-up; immediate short pulse supports a loose weight. An initial lie is
    not a verdict.'
